# Read by claude-rc-alert.service via EnvironmentFile=. The webhook lives here rather than
# inline in the unit because systemd serves unit content over the system bus: with the value
# embedded, `systemctl show claude-rc-alert -p ExecStart` printed the full webhook to any
# local user with no sudo, whatever the unit file's mode (2026-08-24 review M-1). Mirrors
# gitops-deploy and renovate-notify, which were moved off the embed by the 2026-08-23b sweep.
ALERT_WEBHOOK={{ gitops_deploy_discord_webhook }}
